'''Hermit Peng''' (ペ仙人 ''Pe Sennin'', '''Hermit Pe''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.5 Update|Version 2.5]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Hermit Peng
|image = E 109.png
|first appearance = [[Day Job = Boxers]]
|latest appearance = [[Infernal Tower/Floor 15|Infernal Tower - Floor 15]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Hermit Peng is basically a [[Jackie Peng]], except he has a lot more attack power + health, and has [[Area Attack]]. Attacks by spinning around in the air, dealing massive damage to all within his range. One thing to note is that he only appears at 100% strength magnification in two stages, [[Day Job = Boxers]] and [[September Gauntlet/About Town Lv.1~10|About Town Lv.1]].

==Strategy==
A good strategy to defeat the Hermit Peng is to spam meatshields such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], while sending Cats with high attack power and long range, such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], to damage him while staying out of Hermit Peng's range. [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] can also be used to defeat Hermit Peng, as Hermit Peng's range is not long enough to reach her from behind meatshields.

